ith the display showing their tracking notification in full view","international-prices.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7S3VJ7c43Q3f7tp_Customerreceivingdeliverynotificationonphone.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C6%2C6888%2C4581&w=1000&h=665","Z7S3VJ7c43Q3f7tp",{"x":44,"y":63,"zoom":45,"background":46},6,"none","Cheap and reliable international parcel delivery",[67,70,73,76],{"type":24,"text":68,"spans":69,"direction":27},"Sending a parcel to Europe, America, or beyond? At Evri, we provide a low-cost international shipping service with regular tracking updates, delivering to over 200 countries and territories. ",[],{"type":24,"text":71,"spans":72,"direction":27},"Our prices are based on parcel size and weight, delivery service and optional extras. We include £20 parcel cover on most items, with upgrade options up to £999. Each delivery also includes end-to-end tracking for no additional cost! ",[],{"type":24,"text":74,"spans":75,"direction":27},"Check out the prices on our most popular countries, or simply get a quick quote on your destination. ",[],{"type":24,"text":77,"spans":78,"direction":27},"Remember: Frequent Seller Accounts access 10-20% off the prices shown.",[],"Get a quote",{"link_type":30,"key":81,"url":32},"48139228-1bab-42cb-b533-edf04fcd07f5","card$36ccb588-5803-4070-baaf-99520cbcf353","card",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":85,"primary":147,"id":157,"slice_type":158,"slice_label":33},[86,91,96,101,105,109,113,117,122,126,128,131,135,139,143],{"column_1_cell":87,"column_2_cell":88,"column_3_cell":89,"column_4_cell":90},"USA","£10.89","£11.59","£11.39",{"column_1_cell":92,"column_2_cell":93,"column_3_cell":94,"column_4_cell":95},"Australia","£10.59","£11.69","£11.09",{"column_1_cell":97,"column_2_cell":98,"column_3_cell":99,"column_4_cell":100},"Austria","£8.89","-","£9.39",{"column_1_cell":102,"column_2_cell":103,"column_3_cell":99,"column_4_cell":104},"Belgium","£8.69","£9.19",{"column_1_cell":106,"column_2_cell":107,"column_3_cell":99,"column_4_cell":108},"Canada","£12.99","£13.49",{"column_1_cell":110,"column_2_cell":111,"column_3_cell":99,"column_4_cell":112},"Czech Republic","£6.08","£6.58",{"column_1_cell":114,"column_2_cell":115,"column_3_cell":116,"column_4_cell":116},"France","£8.79","£9.29",{"column_1_cell":118,"column_2_cell":119,"column_3_cell":120,"column_4_cell":121},"Germany","£7.29","£7.69","£7.79",{"column_1_cell":123,"column_2_cell":124,"column_3_cell":125,"column_4_cell":125},"Ireland","£7.89","£8.39",{"column_1_cell":127,"column_2_cell":103,"column_3_cell":104,"column_4_cell":104},"Italy",{"column_1_cell":129,"column_2_cell":130,"column_3_cell":99,"column_4_cell":94},"Japan","£11.19",{"column_1_cell":132,"column_2_cell":133,"column_3_cell":124,"column_4_cell":134},"Netherlands","£7.49","£7.99",{"column_1_cell":136,"column_2_cell":137,"column_3_cell":99,"column_4_cell":138},"New Zealand","£11.89","£12.39",{"column_1_cell":140,"column_2_cell":141,"column_3_cell":142,"column_4_cell":142},"Spain","£8.59","£9.09",{"column_1_cell":144,"column_2_cell":145,"column_3_cell":99,"column_4_cell":146},"Switzerland","£10.79","£11.29",{"SectionTitle":148,"SectionSubtitle":149,"TableFooter":150,"InformationTableButtonUrl":151,"InformationTableButtonText":33,"table_header_row_blue":152,"table_rightmost_column_blue":49,"column_name_1":153,"column_name_2":154,"column_name_3":155,"column_name_4":156},"International posting prices","Check the prices for our most popular international destinations. You can choose to drop off your parcel at a ParcelShop with standard or priority delivery, or book a courier collection straight from your doorstep.","Prices quoted are for a 250g tracked parcel delivery and may change outside the EU based on the volumetric weight of parcels.",{"link_type":35},true,"Country","ParcelShop Standard","ParcelShop Priority","Courier Collection","information_table_v2$35346b12-b258-43f9-af3f-bf44f68a382b","information_table_v2",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":160,"primary":227,"id":230,"slice_type":231,"slice_label":33},[161,175,188,201,214],{"title":162,"content":163,"isNumbered":49,"icon":167,"image":174},"£20 FREE parcel cover",[164],{"type":24,"text":165,"spans":166,"direction":27},"Get compensation on missing or damaged parcels up to £20 for free, or upgrade your cover up to the parcel value of £999.",[],{"dimensions":168,"alt":170,"copyright":33,"url":171,"id":172,"edit":173},{"width":169,"height":169},40,"Money icon","international-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":46},{},{"title":176,"content":177,"isNumbered":49,"icon":181,"image":187},"FREE end-to-end tracking",[178],{"type":24,"text":179,"spans":180,"direction":27},"You and your recipient will have instant access to an online tracking platform to keep tabs on your parcel's journey.",[],{"dimensions":182,"alt":183,"copyright":33,"url":184,"id":185,"edit":186},{"width":169,"height":169},"Track location icon","international-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg","Yh96FRIAACgA-Zrj",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":46},{},{"title":189,"content":190,"isNumbered":49,"icon":194,"image":200},"Customs made simple",[191],{"type":24,"text":192,"spans":193,"direction":27},"Complete your customs form online during the parcel booking process and we'll take care of all the paperwork for you. ",[],{"dimensions":195,"alt":196,"copyright":33,"url":197,"id":198,"edit":199},{"width":169,"height":169},"Followed instructions icon","international-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0b60c675-436d-4ca1-8857-2bfbff3cb847_followed_instructions.svg","YflB_BEAACIA8pcK",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":46},{},{"title":202,"content":203,"isNumbered":49,"icon":207,"image":213},"Drop-off options to suit your needs",[204],{"type":24,"text":205,"spans":206,"direction":27},"Send your international parcels via courier collection or drop off at one of 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers across the UK",[],{"dimensions":208,"alt":209,"copyright":33,"url":210,"id":211,"edit":212},{"width":169,"height":169},"Parcelshop icon","international-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F6fb8763e-f02b-40b7-8e67-a916528bac93_parcelshop.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsl",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":46},{},{"title":215,"content":216,"isNumbered":49,"icon":220,"image":226},"Send parcels in bulk",[217],{"type":24,"text":218,"spans":219,"direction":27},"Easily book multiple parcels by connecting your eBay, Amazon, or Shopify store to your Evri account.",[],{"dimensions":221,"alt":222,"copyright":33,"url":223,"id":224,"edit":225},{"width":169,"height":169},"Laptop icon","international-prices.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":44,"y":44,"zoom":45,"background":46},{},{"theme":20,"title":228,"description":229,"showPaddingTop":49},"Why send internationally with Evri?","Take advantage of these benefits for no additional cost when you send an international parcel with Evri:","list_block$e9d1c92a-f133-4a67-b879-53aba6a003d8","list_block",{"variation":233,"version":17,"items":234,"primary":235,"id":281,"slice_type":282,"slice_label":33},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":20,"show_premium_logo":49,"label":33,"label_theme":236,"titleH2":237,"bodyText":238,"image":270,"rightImage":49,"buttonText":33,"buttonLink":279,"buttonDataGtmTrack":33,"primary_button_external":49,"button_secondary":280,"secondary_button_external":49},"Core","How are our prices calculated?",[239,242,246,249,252,255,258],{"type":24,"text":240,"spans":241,"direction":27},"When calculating shipping costs internationally, we base parcel prices on the four areas below.",[],{"type":243,"text":244,"spans":245,"direction":27},"list-item","The weight of your parcel – parcels sent with Evri cannot exceed 15kg",[],{"type":243,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":27},"Your parcel’s destination – pricing varies by country due to distance, available transport routes, and partnerships with local delivery networks.",[],{"type":243,"text":250,"spans":251,"direction":27},"In some cases, we may charge more for larger parcels, even if they’re lightweight. This is known as volumetric pricing. Regardless of the size or weight of your parcel, the price you pay for shipping will always be clearly shown in your basket with no hidden costs or fees.",[],{"type":243,"text":253,"spans":254,"direction":27},"How you want to send your parcel – whether via Courier, ParcelShop, or Locker, your chosen drop-off option will impact your parcel’s overall price.",[],{"type":24,"text":256,"spans":257,"direction":27},"All international parcels are covered up to a value of £20, for free, and this includes parcels with international shipping costs. International parcels can also be covered up to a value of £999, so long as they are items that we can cover.",[],{"type":24,"text":259,"spans":260,"direction":27},"Take a look at our list of non-compensation items if you’re unsure whether your item can be covered.",[261,268],{"start":262,"end":263,"type":264,"data":265},27,49,"hyperlink",{"link_type":30,"url":266,"target":267},"\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send","_blank",{"start":262,"end":263,"type":269},"strong",{"dimensions":271,"alt":274,"copyright":33,"url":275,"id":276,"edit":277},{"width":272,"height":273},2000,1300,"A father is measuring the circumference of a parcel box at his desk using measuring tape. His children are resting on the sofa behind him.","international-prices.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc-5bqstJ9-inW_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7708.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C70%2C8192%2C5325&w=2000&h=1300","Z6zc-5bqstJ9-inW",{"x":44,"y":278,"zoom":45,"background":46},70,{"link_type":35},{"link_type":35},"landing_feature_banner$e6736587-d2cc-4ef4-9d92-c3706475c5a5","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":284,"primary":303,"id":325,"slice_type":326,"slice_label":33},[285,288,291,294,297,300],{"column_1_cell":87,"column_2_cell":88,"column_3_cell":286,"column_4_cell":287},"£9.26","£8.71",{"column_1_cell":92,"column_2_cell":93,"column_3_cell":289,"column_4_cell":290},"£9.00","£8.47",{"column_1_cell":106,"column_2_cell":107,"column_3_cell":292,"column_4_cell":293},"£11.04","£10.39",{"column_1_cell":114,"column_2_cell":115,"column_3_cell":295,"column_4_cell":296},"£7.47","£7.03",{"column_1_cell":118,"column_2_cell":119,"column_3_cell":298,"column_4_cell":299},"£6.20","£5.83",{"column_1_cell":123,"column_2_cell":124,"column_3_cell":301,"column_4_cell":302},"£6.71","£6.31",{"PricingTableImage":304,"PricingTableHeader":305,"PricingTableText":306,"PricingTableButtonText":316,"PricingTableButtonUrl":317,"scrollDown":49,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonText":33,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonUrl":320,"buttonGtmTrack":33,"PricingTableDescription":321,"table_header_row_blue":49,"table_rightmost_column_blue":49,"column_name_1":153,"column_name_2":322,"column_name_3":323,"column_name_4":324},{},"Save on shipping with a Frequent Seller Account",[307,310,313],{"type":24,"text":308,"spans":309,"direction":27},"If you send more than 20 international parcels a month - or 40 UK parcels - you can save on every shipment with a Frequent Seller Account. ",[],{"type":24,"text":311,"spans":312,"direction":27},"As your business grows, so do your discounts, meaning the more you send, the better the savings. ",[],{"type":24,"text":314,"spans":315,"direction":27},"Access Level 1 discounts when you send 20 international parcels a month and unlock even cheaper pricing on Level 2 when you send 40+.",[],"Find out more",{"link_type":30,"key":318,"url":319},"28f50de1-620d-410b-99a5-cf581a892e26","\u002Ffrequent-seller",{"link_type":35},"Prices quoted are \"starting from\" prices for a Standard ParcelShop delivery and may change outside the EU based on volumetric weight of parcels.","Evri.com","Level 1","Level 2","pricing_table_v2$1c89614e-e904-40f0-98c6-c7e85e439175","pricing_table_v2",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":328,"primary":359,"id":369,"slice_type":370,"slice_label":33},[329,334,339,344,349,354],{"Url":330,"Text":333},{"link_type":30,"key":331,"url":332},"19be8cb6-c7d2-4e5a-99ea-cd2f7816df8a","\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel","How to send an international parcel",{"Url":335,"Text":338},{"link_type":30,"key":336,"url":337},"01c629b0-829e-4787-a5e4-954f92db57cc","\u002Fsend\u002Fparcel-size-and-weight-guide","How to measure and weigh your parcel",{"Url":340,"Text":343},{"link_type":30,"key":341,"url":342},"56a09631-89bc-4588-955a-04704576d9fd","\u002Fguides\u002Fsend-gifts-abroad","Sending gifts internationally",{"Url":345,"Text":348},{"link_type":30,"key":346,"url":347},"91dee6d4-dc48-4d1d-bbc7-c947690edab9","\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel","How to wrap a parcel",{"Url":350,"Text":353},{"link_type":30,"key":351,"url":352},"7e2513fd-d26b-4c42-961a-2fa2330b388c","\u002Fguides\u002Feasy-steps-to-packaging-fragile-items","How to package fragile items",{"Url":355,"Text":358},{"link_type":30,"key":356,"url":357},"8fe3f332-a54a-4d0a-8bca-b90d73e569bb","\u002Fparcelshops","How to use our ParcelShop service",{"SectionTitle":360,"description":365,"theme":20},[361],{"type":362,"text":363,"spans":364,"direction":27},"heading2","Helpful how-to guides",[],[366],{"type":24,"text":367,"spans":368,"direction":27},"Need help to prepare your parcel for delivery overseas? Take a look at our how-to guides to get your parcels ready for shipping.",[],"link_block$74b79ed2-2f4c-4132-99e0-99173c12d42f","link_block",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":372,"primary":460,"id":462,"slice_type":463,"slice_label":33},[373,379,451],{"questionTitle":374,"questionBody":375},"What happens if my parcel is bigger\u002Fheavier than declared",[376],{"type":24,"text":377,"spans":378,"direction":27},"We realise that mistakes can happen, however, we ask for your help to ensure we can keep our prices as low as possible by carefully weighing and measuring your parcel. We rely on customer accuracy to ensure our pricing is the best we can offer, but inaccuracies in dimensions can result in large volumetric differences. Should extra payments become due, we reserve the right to recover them.",[],{"questionTitle":380,"questionBody":381},"Why can I not get a quote for my destination country?",[382,385,388,391,394,397,400,403,406,409,412,415,418,421,424,427,430,433,436,439,442,445,448],{"type":24,"text":383,"spans":384,"direction":27},"There are certain countries that we unfortunately cannot ship to, which are:",[],{"type":243,"text":386,"spans":387,"direction":27},"Afghanistan",[],{"type":243,"text":389,"spans":390,"direction":27},"Belarus",[],{"type":243,"text":392,"spans":393,"direction":27},"Crimea",[],{"type":243,"text":395,"spans":396,"direction":27},"Cuba",[],{"type":243,"text":398,"spans":399,"direction":27},"Ghana",[],{"type":243,"text":401,"spans":402,"direction":27},"Iran",[],{"type":243,"text":404,"spans":405,"direction":27},"Ivory Coast",[],{"type":243,"text":407,"spans":408,"direction":27},"Kyrgyzstan",[],{"type":243,"text":410,"spans":411,"direction":27},"Nieu",[],{"type":243,"text":413,"spans":414,"direction":27},"Nigeria",[],{"type":243,"text":416,"spans":417,"direction":27},"Nevis",[],{"type":243,"text":419,"spans":420,"direction":27},"North Korea",[],{"type":243,"text":422,"spans":423,"direction":27},"Myanmar",[],{"type":243,"text":425,"spans":426,"direction":27},"Russia",[],{"type":243,"text":428,"spans":429,"direction":27},"Sao Tome & Principe",[],{"type":243,"text":431,"spans":432,"direction":27},"Somalia",[],{"type":243,"text":434,"spans":435,"direction":27},"South Africa",[],{"type":243,"text":437,"spans":438,"direction":27},"Sudan",[],{"type":243,"text":440,"spans":441,"direction":27},"Syria",[],{"type":243,"text":443,"spans":444,"direction":27},"Tahiti",[],{"type":243,"text":446,"spans":447,"direction":27},"Western Samoa",[],{"type":243,"text":449,"spans":450,"direction":27},"Venezuela",[],{"questionTitle":452,"questionBody":453},"Can I send a parcel with Delivery Duties Paid (DDP)?",[454,457],{"type":24,"text":455,"spans":456,"direction":27},"We’re pleased to offer DDP for parcels heading to the USA, giving you the option to cover customs and duties for your recipient.",[],{"type":24,"text":458,"spans":459,"direction":27},"For all other international routes, we currently only offer Delivered at Place (DAP), where the recipient is responsible for import costs. We do our best to notify recipients ahead of time if any taxes or duties are due, so their delivery isn’t delayed.",[],{"title":461},"International shipping cost FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$abcbcecf-4c21-416f-8b0b-32d2370b3bcb","frequently_asked_questions",[15,52,84,159,232,283,327,371],["Reactive",466],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":467,"$sclients":532,"$sglobal-basket-count":33},{"abtasty":468,"accessibe":471,"appPromoBanner":474,"autoDivertUpdates":477,"awin":480,"bulkInternational":483,"bulkSendEnabled":486,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":489,"enableBasketCount":492,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":495,"euCustomsDuty":498,"groovyAdvert":501,"newInternationalSendFlow":504,"newinternationalpages":510,"oohPreferenceFlag":514,"opentel":517,"premium":520,"savedCards":523,"smallParcelSize":526,"yourPricesDrawer":529},{"_createdAt":469,"_updatedAt":470,"enabled":152},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":472,"_updatedAt":473,"enabled":152},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":475,"_updatedAt":476,"enabled":49},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":478,"_updatedAt":479,"enabled":49},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":481,"_updatedAt":482,"enabled":49},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26